{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"72f7facf6be38f96d72d8b776a7d2a5f9cce63671034f47bc9489ca6abe60b52","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"6d25e6c6e74f8bfbde5c2133a790abbc45055ff3659bc22788c777f238e8d7da","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"漏译体型信息：源文 this massive humanoid 的 massive 在译文「丑陋的绿皮生物」中完全消失，humanoid（类人生物）也被弱化为泛称「生物」。补查：组件 tome，公开源码 game/modules/tome/data/general/npcs/troll.lua，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，第 54-59 行为 newEntity{base=\"BASE_NPC_TROLL\", name=\"forest troll\"...}，第 56 行 desc=_t[[Green-skinned and ugly, this massive humanoid glares at you, clenching wart-covered green fists.]]；该 desc 是玩家查看森林巨魔时的唯一体型描述，删去 massive 后译文不再传达其庞大与类人形态。"},{"revision_key":"6d3ab2bbdb7f62fd308298b08cae804fb87a4764b74654362537458f64936360","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"6d405a197c57bccfb4d2562adeffa54ce3112e38719818ee5f7a038b2e713c07","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"6d50696084aa0e73f20ed27e88516d984e321166bbe19be4c4836568f498f501","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"6def9496cc5c2d2d2bd433722d84179e5a3f75a68e387bd16d551689031a34ff","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"两处语义偏离：一是 a huge orc 的 huge 未译，译文「一只……兽人」无任何体型信息；二是 You must pass（你必须通过）被改写为「你必须打倒他」，把「通过」这一目标替换成「击杀」这一手段，属于源文没有的断定。补查：组件 tome，公开源码 game/modules/tome/data/zones/reknor-escape/npcs.lua，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，第 41-47 行定义 name=\"Brotoq the Reaver\"，第 44 行 desc=_t[[A huge orc blocks your way to the Iron Council. You must pass.]]，源文只陈述必须通行，未规定击杀。另「一只」用于人形兽人量词不当，且与后句「他」不一致。"},{"revision_key":"6e263e739d1458cc1ddcb4fd144094d03f0df16c87059843399399a714b607a0","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"术语失指：Continuum 指时空连续体，译文「连续紊乱」中的「连续」是形容词性的「接连不断」，读者无法看出该状态与时空有关。补查：组件 tome，公开源码 game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/other.lua，固定 commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63，第 544-549 行 newEffect{name=\"CONTINUUM_DESTABILIZATION\", desc=_t\"Continuum Destabilization\", long_desc=...\"The target has been affected by space or time manipulations and is becoming more resistant to them (+%d).\", type=\"other\", subtype={time=true}}；long_desc 与 subtype 均把该效果锚定在空间/时间操控上，译名应保留「时空」这一限定。"}]}